4</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20051004133547&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Large_Amphora_aabb95.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a large amphora. It is empty.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Obtainable by unpacking a Large Amphora Kit. Before a major graphical update, this item was extremely rare. Only 3 existed on each server and were only obtainable through a bug. Large Amphoras were highly sought after for decoration and rare item collections, and players often payed up to 250,000 gp for them. Due to the update however, all houses and guild halls had to be cleared of items, which meant that items that were not able to be placed inside of a deposit box (such as Large Amphoras) had to be deleted. Afterwards, CipSoft made this item available from NPCs for a mere 50 gp.<br/>Looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Canopic%20Jar%20%28Object%29\">Canopic Jar (Object)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Canopic%20Jar%20%28Object%29\">Canopic Jar (Object)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Containers</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dorbin\">Dorbin</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eddy\">Eddy</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Edvard\">Edvard</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feizuhl\">Feizuhl</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gamon\">Gamon</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Greater%20Canopic%20Jar\">Greater Canopic Jar</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Haani\">Haani</a></li><li>Hireling</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hofech\">Hofech</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Inkaef\">Inkaef</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iwar\">Iwar</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Janz\">Janz</a></li><li>Large Amphora Kit</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Large%20Used%20Amphora%20Kit\">Large Used Amphora Kit</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/lions-rock-quest\">Lion's Rock Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nydala\">Nydala</a></li><li>Other Objects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Peggy\">Peggy</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ukea\">Ukea</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vera\">Vera</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yoem\">Yoem</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["lions-rock-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"lions-rock-quest","quest":"Lion's Rock Quest","step":"3-1","n":11,"title":"Apanhar o Translation Scroll","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33114,"y":32296,"z":9,"label":"Buraco para descer"},{"x":33122,"y":32281,"z":10,"label":"Subida"},{"x":33119,"y":32247,"z":9,"label":"Large Amphora"}]}]}}